.Dd March 2, 2026
.Dt ELF_OPEN_MEMORY 3
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm elf_open_memory
.Nd open and parse an ELF object from a caller-provided memory buffer
.Sh LIBRARY
libelfobj
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In elfobj.h
.Ft elf_err_t
.Fn elf_open_memory "const void *buf" "size_t size" "elfobj_t **out"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Fn elf_open_memory
parses ELF bytes from
.Fa buf
and
.Fa size .
The default behavior copies input bytes into object-owned storage.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
Returns
.Dv ELF_OK
on success and stores the resulting object in
.Fa *out .
Returns an
.Vt elf_err_t
on failure.
.Sh ERRORS
Possible errors include
.Dv ELF_ERR_STATE ,
.Dv ELF_ERR_OOM ,
and ELF format/parse errors.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr elf_open 3 ,
.Xr elf_open_memory_nocopy 3 ,
.Xr elf_open_memory_with_options 3
